            {
                "entry_id": "db752f4f-6102-3dc2-aa8b-d2ced4fa5dc7",
                "word": "Mohammedan",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e1e3d90f-a689-418c-8610-89fe394e048b",
                        "entry_id": "db752f4f-6102-3dc2-aa8b-d2ced4fa5dc7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Mohammedans"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dba43b77-bda1-3a9d-a63b-e1ab08d5dbfb",
                        "entry_id": "db752f4f-6102-3dc2-aa8b-d2ced4fa5dc7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "穆斯林，回教徒"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "現基本棄用和冒犯"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "98d3a4f7-49dd-4e6d-8b66-9dae62f99eb7",
                                "sense_id": "dba43b77-bda1-3a9d-a63b-e1ab08d5dbfb",
                                "text": "MOSQUE (Fr. mosquée, from Sp. mezquita, from Ar. masjid, temple, from sajada, to prostrate one's self, to pray). A Mohammedan house of prayer and worship. Examples of these buildings are found wherever the Mohammedan faith has prevailed, from Spain to India and Turkestan.",
                                "translation": "MOSQUE（清真寺，法語 mosquée，來自西班牙語 mezquita，來自阿拉伯語 masjid“寺廟”，來自 sajada“俯伏在地，祈祷”）。伊斯兰教祈祷和礼拜场所。从西班牙到印度和突厥斯坦，只要是伊斯兰信仰盛行的地方，都可以找到这种建筑。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a1c2587-5fe5-4486-85de-27a31e98644b",
                                "sense_id": "dba43b77-bda1-3a9d-a63b-e1ab08d5dbfb",
                                "text": "Mohammedan prisoners shall be allowed to observe the fast of Ramadan and during the fast shall be required to labour at such reduced task as the Medical Officer considers proper.",
                                "translation": "回教囚犯須獲准守齋月，守齋期間只須從事醫生認為是適當的和經削減的工作。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
